---
title: Caprese salad
servings: 2
tags: [italian, salad, quick, vegetarian]
source: https://github.com/cooklang/cookcli
description: Tomatoes, mozzarella and basil. Simple, fresh and quick.
---

Slice the @tomatoes{3}(large, ripe) and the @mozzarella{200%g}(fresh) into rounds about 5 mm thick.

Arrange the slices alternately on a #serving plate{}, overlapping slightly.

Tuck @basil{8%leaves}(fresh) between the slices.

Drizzle with @extra virgin olive oil{2%tbsp} and @balsamic vinegar{1%tbsp}.

Season with @flaky salt{} and @black pepper{} to taste, and serve at room temperature.
